1. PHPStan functionMap — the builtin declared-return envelope table
================================================================================

Files derived from this material:

    docs/research/phpstan-mining/declared_envelopes.toml
    crates/steins-catalog/src/declared_envelopes_generated.rs

The builtin return-type declarations in those files are mined from PHPStan's
`resources/functionMap.php`, at phpstan-src commit
dcde2be6ca3caae0e0d4bee6bfbc9fd39ea560e7. The mined data is reduced to plain
function names and single-base return envelopes, and each row is cross-checked
against PHP 8.5.8's own reflection before it is emitted (ADR-0069).

The lineage has two links, and both are named here because PHPStan's own file
names the first one in its header: `resources/functionMap.php` is copied from
Phan's `src/Phan/Language/Internal/FunctionSignatureMap.php`.

    Steins
      <- phpstan-src, resources/functionMap.php
           MIT — https://github.com/phpstan/phpstan-src
      <- Phan, src/Phan/Language/Internal/FunctionSignatureMap.php
           MIT — https://github.com/phan/phan/blob/v6/LICENSE

